# Concerted Effort ({2}{W}{W}): creatures you control gain protection until end of turn from whatever a creature you control has
# protection from - from a mana value too (CR 702.16a). Two Mistmeadow Skulks each have protection from mana value 3 or
# greater, and the two together still give "3 or greater" (the least of them), so at Bot1's upkeep on turn 5 the Skulks
# still have it, and Memnite, which has no protection of its own, gains exactly "3 or greater". A Skulk attacks: Bot2's Gray Ogre (mana value 3, the limit) can't block it, while the Ornithopter (mana
# value 0) can (the control) and takes its 1 damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mistmeadow Skulk
Black Lotus
Mistmeadow Skulk
Concerted Effort
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Plains x11

[Bot2 Deck]
